### Method III: 4D Spectral Voxel Instrument (Refined)

```javascript
const filter = new Tone.Filter(2000, 'lowpass').toDestination();
const synth = new Tone.PolySynth(Tone.Synth).connect(filter);

const playVoxel = (x, y, z, w) => {
  const freqFactor = (w + 1) * 0.5;
  filter.frequency.rampTo(200 + (freqFactor * 800), 0.1);
  synth.triggerAttackRelease(['E2', 'G3', 'B3'], '8n', undefined, 0.4 + (w * 0.1));
};
```
*Spatial resonance is now gated by the W-axis depth, creating clean, airy transitions between E-minor and G-major harmonic nodes.*

